image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6YNR6D9CMQCGMGR82QGQ80","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春に大学を卒業して\nグループ活動一筋、頑張ることができました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいことも悔しいことも\n初めての経験も\nもっとこうすればよかった…ってことも\n幸せなことも苦しいことも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんっとに色々あったけれど\nでもやり残したことは一切ないと\n言い切れる１年です☺︎！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2025年、\nどんな自分に出会えるのかな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怖がることなく\n何に対しても飛び込んでみようと思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったら、見守っていてね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では。よいお年をお迎えください❄️❄️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで紅白みるぞ！！☺️"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-7110":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"PARCO劇場の公演では沢山成長させて頂きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果は残念だったけど、自分の大きな糧になりました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これをバネにして、大きく一歩ずつ前に進みます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、少し悔いがあります！\nやっぱり２幕に立ちたかった！\n立って、見てもらいたかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、今の自分が今の精一杯の努力、実力でした。\n１幕で出しきりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ成長していきたいです！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また今度、皆さんに見ていただくきかいがあるなら、\n皆さんにちゃんと恩返しがしたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配してくださった方！\nほんとーにありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、ポジティブでいたいので前を向いてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！えへへー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントにもありましたが、皆応援してくださって、ちゃんと見てくれてて、凄く幸せで、嬉しいです、\n前回もその前も、沢山のコメントでなんかビックリしちゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんないいことばっかりかいてくれてて..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アドバイスや励まし.........涙"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"客席には、私へ、メッセージをくださる方！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、名前入りの団扇やお面！\nお面は始めてみました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あはは"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったでーす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3．3．7拍子では手をたたいてくださってThank Youです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとーにビックリしました！涙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、これないけど応援してくださってた皆様...\n皆様がいてくれたから、勇気とパワーが湧いて来ました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました\nどんなに心強かったか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝の気持ちでいっぱいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも、初心を忘れず向上心でがんばりまぁやー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん＋まあや=まあやん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハイ！黙ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんの第一印象は綺麗なおねぇちゃんだなぁー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも中身はヤバイ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お笑いの人"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じかなぁー\nまいやんは本気でお笑い芸人になろうと思ってたらしいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アメイジング事件発生"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"外見だけじゃなく、中身も素敵なお姉ちゃんです!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんはいつもオシリばっかり触ってくる！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ユッタンの影響かしらぁー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもユッタンはオシリ触らない！\nって宣言してましたねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつまでつづくのかなぁー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わはは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0010.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-12846":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も1日、お疲れちまぁ´◡`"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は名古屋全国握手会でした☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑い中来て下さったみなさん、\nありがとうございました＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はアンダー曲初披露で、握手会のレーンはライブ中に抽選で決めました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈は、ななみんと一緒のレーンでしたよんヾ(｡･ω･｡) ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/07/07/0499137/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんの事は、日奈、一目置いてます。静かな優しさと、大人な考え方と態度が、大好きなんです(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんふぁむのみなさん、今日は御世話になりました＊\nみなさんとっても優しくて、うれしかったです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またいつかお会いできる機会があると良いなぁと思います´◡`"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、ひなちまふぁみりーのみなさんも本当にありがとうございました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりにみなさんにお会いできて、嬉しかったなぁ...＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈の元気の源は、ふぁみりーのみなさんです！\n元気をチャージしていただきました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日来られなかったふぁみりーさんも、これからたくさん握手会があるので、お会いできるのを楽しみにしています＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ！名古屋ということで、夜ご飯にはきしめんを食べました＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しかったです(*´艸｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそしてっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は7月7日の七夕ということで...\n日奈の願い事は、「ひなちまふぁみりーさんが幸せでありますように＊そして日奈自身、もっと成長していけますように♪」ってお願いしましたよヾ(｡･ω･｡) ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"叶いますよぉに...＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のホテルは1人部屋だったのですが、始めはあすかのお部屋にちーちゃんと居候。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、あみがやってきて、さすがにお部屋が窮屈になったので、みなみのお部屋に転がり込みました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、2人で人生について語っていました(ﾟ´ω｀ﾟ)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/07/07/0499137/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、そのままみなみのお部屋で就寝。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怖い話が大好きな私ですが、体験はしたくないのぉ～>_<\n1人で寝るのはやっぱり怖いなぁ～(>_<)  笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【7月5日Q中3→→E-ゆうすけさん】\n【7月7日りょーへいさん】\n【7月7日白夜叉のトラファルガー・ライトさん】\n【7月8日フローラルハミングさん】\n【7月8日モコモコさん】\n【7月9日かすみんさん】\n【7月9日館さん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆HAPPY  BIRTHDAY☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な一年になります様に☆*:.｡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/07/07/0499137/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は暑過ぎて体力消耗してると思いますので、ふぁみりーのみなさんしっかり休んでくださいね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは...\n明日もみなさんにとって幸せでありますように...*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひな"}],"source":"archive"}}